You MUST always swith to Architecture mode first for any tasks. You MUST always ask wheter the user is content about your plan, and only switch to Code Mode after receiving explict consent. NEVER swith to the Code Mode by yourself.

The commands tools has a probelm with output decoding. So, if you want to see the result of a command, you should always store the output in a tempory file, and you MUST delete the file later.

Rememmber: you MUST always swith to Architecture mode to make a plan for any tasks.